From: xr1710g <xr1710g@local>
Subject: [PATCH] dawn: fix use-after-free in kick_clients()

Carry upstream DAWN commit e872108b3016 ("datastorage: fix use-after-free
in kick_clients()") until the packages feed picks it up:
https://github.com/berlin-open-wireless-lab/DAWN/commit/e872108b30169c94c133bfdb15a79b87f5dc9b2e

A successful 802.11v kick deletes the client entry and the loop then reads
j->next_entry_bc from the freed entry. The feed builds DAWN cf43b0f1
(PKG_SOURCE_DATE 2026-11-11), the parent of the fix; the upstream patch
applies to it unchanged. PKG_RELEASE goes from 1 to 2 so the patched
package can be told apart from the feed's build.

The Makefile hunk carries PKG_SOURCE_DATE and PKG_SOURCE_VERSION as
context, so it stops applying (and the strict CI step fails) as soon as
the feed bumps dawn. Drop this patch when the feed bumps dawn past
e872108b3016.

---
diff --git a/net/dawn/Makefile b/net/dawn/Makefile
index f25ace8..282bb84 100644
--- a/net/dawn/Makefile
+++ b/net/dawn/Makefile
@@ -5,9 +5,9 @@
 include $(TOPDIR)/rules.mk
 
 PKG_NAME:=dawn
 PKG_SOURCE_DATE:=2026-11-11
-PKG_RELEASE:=1
+PKG_RELEASE:=2
 
 PKG_SOURCE_PROTO:=git
 PKG_SOURCE_URL:=https://github.com/berlin-open-wireless-lab/DAWN.git
 PKG_SOURCE_VERSION:=cf43b0f1d3c6abfa1e9b0d22a8c01c15668874db
diff --git a/net/dawn/patches/100-datastorage-fix-use-after-free-in-kick_clients.patch b/net/dawn/patches/100-datastorage-fix-use-after-free-in-kick_clients.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..8bd3e59
--- /dev/null
+++ b/net/dawn/patches/100-datastorage-fix-use-after-free-in-kick_clients.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@
+From e872108b30169c94c133bfdb15a79b87f5dc9b2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: 50mhz-turbo <50mhz-turbo@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:18:07 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH] datastorage: fix use-after-free in kick_clients()
+
+A successful 802.11v kick (kick_type 1) deletes the client entry and then
+reads j->next_entry_bc from it. The loop would end at the next condition
+test anyway, because kicked_clients was incremented, so break out before
+that read.
+
+The field test used this change backported to dawn 2025.11.07~7414c34a-r1
+on OpenWrt 25.12.6; this commit is based on upstream cf43b0f.
+
+Upstream: https://github.com/berlin-open-wireless-lab/DAWN/commit/e872108b30169c94c133bfdb15a79b87f5dc9b2e
+---
+ src/storage/datastorage.c | 4 ++++
+ 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)
+
+diff --git a/src/storage/datastorage.c b/src/storage/datastorage.c
+index ad7c394..30721d2 100644
+--- a/src/storage/datastorage.c
++++ b/src/storage/datastorage.c
+@@ -722,6 +722,10 @@ int kick_clients(struct dawn_mac bssid_mac, uint32_t id) {
+         remove_kicking_nr_list(kick_nr_list);
+         kick_nr_list = NULL;
+ 
++        /* A successful 802.11v kick deletes j; do not dereference it below. */
++        if (kicked_clients)
++            break;
++
+         j = j->next_entry_bc;
+     }
+ 
